sequenceDiagram
    %% W1D2 — Lost in the Middle: Position-Aware Context Assembly Flow
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Application
    participant VDB as Vector Database
    participant Reranker as LiTM Reranker
    participant LLM as LLM GPT-4o

    User->>App: Submit query
    App->>VDB: Similarity search top-K
    VDB-->>App: Docs with scores [0.92, 0.88, 0.75, 0.20, 0.15, 0.10]
    Note over App: Naive order puts 0.92 and 0.88 at middle positions — dead zone
    App->>Reranker: Apply position-aware ordering
    Reranker->>Reranker: Sort descending by relevance score
    Reranker->>Reranker: Interleave: even-ranked to start, odd-ranked to end
    Reranker->>Reranker: Check token budget per document
    Reranker-->>App: Reordered [0.92, 0.75, 0.15, 0.10, 0.20, 0.88]
    Note over App: Position 0: 0.92 doc (Primacy zone, attention=1.0)
    Note over App: Position 5: 0.88 doc (Recency zone, attention=1.0)
    App->>LLM: Assembled context with high-relevance docs at boundaries
    LLM->>LLM: Attend strongly to positions 0 and 5
    LLM-->>App: Grounded answer citing both edge documents
    App-->>User: Final response with correct diagnosis
